            "id": "722640902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过，之前是「刑部小判」还是「证城」也变成过火把…你们妖狸，是很喜欢变成火把吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640903"
            ]
          },
          "722640903": {
            "id": "722640903",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "变成人类的东西。可以和人类玩。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640904"
            ]
          },
          "722640904": {
            "id": "722640904",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "不然，人一般不和吉法师玩。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640905"
            ]
          },
          "722640905": {
            "id": "722640905",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#没关系，我和{NICKNAME}陪吉法师一起玩！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640906"
            ]
          },
          "722640906": {
            "id": "722640906",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "耶！一起玩！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640907"
            ]
          },
          "722640907": {
            "id": "722640907",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔…不过这前面是断崖，要我们带你过去吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640908"
            ]
          },
          "722640908": {
            "id": "722640908",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "吉法师，飞飞。砰砰！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640909"
            ]
          },
          "722640909": {
            "id": "722640909",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640910"
            ]
          },
          "722640910": {
            "id": "722640910",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "吉法师身上变出了像是气囊的东西，\\n竟借着它的浮力与雪山有些刺骨的风，顺利地飘到了山崖对面。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640911"
            ]
          },
          "722640911": {
            "id": "722640911",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "…那是什么东西啦！到底是怎么回事啦！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7226412",
      "subQuestName": "跟上吉法师",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7226404",
      "subQuestName": "与吉法师对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722640301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722640301": {
            "id": "722640301",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "呶哈哈，好慢好慢。好弱。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640302"
            ]
          },
          "722640302": {
            "id": "722640302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "可恶，这家伙一点也不可爱！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640303"
            ]
          },
          "722640303": {
            "id": "722640303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "吉法师，不能嘲笑别人。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640304"
            ]
          },
          "722640304": {
            "id": "722640304",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "但是，笑不好吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640305"
            ]
          },
          "722640305": {
            "id": "722640305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯…该怎么说呢？笑是好事，但笑别人就不好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640306"
            ]
          },
          "722640306": {
            "id": "722640306",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "要大家都一起笑，才是好的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640307"
            ]
          },
          "722640307": {
            "id": "722640307",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "#知道了。对不起。黄毛{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_UNCLE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_AUNT]}。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640308"
            ]
          },
          "722640308": {
            "id": "722640308",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#不是{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_UNCLE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_AUNT]}，是{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SISTERA]}。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640309"
            ]
          },
          "722640309": {
            "id": "722640309",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#我叫派蒙，黄毛{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SISTERA]}叫{NICKNAME}。吉法师，要好好记住喔！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640310"
            ]
          },
          "722640310": {
            "id": "722640310",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "好难记。好麻烦。白毛黄毛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640311"
            ]
          },
          "722640311": {
            "id": "722640311",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640312"
            ]
          },
          "722640312": {
            "id": "722640312",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "也不用勉强啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640313"
            ]
          },
          "722640313": {
            "id": "722640313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过，刚刚吉法师用的那招是什么？「咻」的一下变出来气球，然后「嗖」的一下就飘过来了的那个，看起来好厉害呀？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640314"
            ]
          },
          "722640314": {
            "id": "722640314",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "八叠砰砰。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640315"
            ]
          },
          "722640315": {
            "id": "722640315",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那到底是什么啦…感觉又听不懂吉法师说的话了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640320",
              "722640318"
            ]
          },
          "722640320": {
            "id": "722640320",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "那个，白毛黄毛没有？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640321"
            ]
          },
          "722640321": {
            "id": "722640321",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "白毛能飞飞。黄毛也能飞飞。所以白毛黄毛有。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640322"
            ]
          },
          "722640322": {
            "id": "722640322",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这、这么说也没错…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640323"
            ]
          },
          "722640323": {
            "id": "722640323",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "可能是什么妖狸才有的力量吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640324"
            ]
          },
          "722640324": {
            "id": "722640324",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "嗯。雪山好玩。前进前进。"
          },
          "722640318": {
            "id": "722640318",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "噗噗，菫瓜砰砰。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640319"
            ]
          },
          "722640319": {
            "id": "722640319",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "到底是什么意思啦！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7226405",
      "subQuestName": "与吉法师玩耍",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722640501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722640501": {
            "id": "722640501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "黄毛厉害。好强好强。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640505",
              "722640504"
            ]
          },
          "722640505": {
            "id": "722640505",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对了！相片应该没问题吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640506"
            ]
          },
          "722640506": {
            "id": "722640506",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "向吉法师与派蒙展示刚刚拍的相片。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640507"
            ]
          },
          "722640507": {
            "id": "722640507",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "噗噗，好像吉法师喔这个。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640508"
            ]
          },
          "722640508": {
            "id": "722640508",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这就是吉法师喔。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640509"
            ]
          },
          "722640509": {
            "id": "722640509",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "呶？但是，吉法师是我。只有一个。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640510"
            ]
          },
          "722640510": {
            "id": "722640510",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯，这个不是吉法师啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640511"
            ]
          },
          "722640511": {
            "id": "722640511",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "雪山有妖狸？但是，没闻到。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640512"
            ]
          },
          "722640512": {
            "id": "722640512",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，不是的，龙脊雪山没有妖狸。这个就是吉法师啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640513"
            ]
          },
          "722640513": {
            "id": "722640513",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640514"
            ]
          },
          "722640514": {
            "id": "722640514",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640515"
            ]
          },
          "722640515": {
            "id": "722640515",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（向吉法师解释相片的事情…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640516"
            ]
          },
          "722640516": {
            "id": "722640516",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "原来是画。白毛真笨。呶哈哈。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640517"
            ]
          },
          "722640517": {
            "id": "722640517",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呜呜，虽然好生气，但不知道怎么反驳…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640518"
            ]
          },
          "722640518": {
            "id": "722640518",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "不笑了。一起笑才是好的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640519"
            ]
          },
          "722640519": {
            "id": "722640519",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "可恶…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640520"
            ]
          },
          "722640520": {
            "id": "722640520",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "吉法师真乖，表扬。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640521"
            ]
          },
          "722640521": {
            "id": "722640521",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "表扬！耶！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640522"
            ]
          },
          "722640522": {
            "id": "722640522",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯…那今天就到这里吧。吉法师也累了吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640523"
            ]
          },
          "722640523": {
            "id": "722640523",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "嗯。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640524"
            ]
          },
          "722640524": {
            "id": "722640524",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那我们回去向五百藏报告吧。毕竟，五百藏感觉还挺担心的。"
          },
          "722640504": {
            "id": "722640504",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "喂！真没礼貌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7226410",
      "subQuestName": "与吉法师对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722640401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722640401": {
            "id": "722640401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "这些生类…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640402"
            ]
          },
          "722640402": {
            "id": "722640402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "生类…是指这些雪猪吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640403"
            ]
          },
          "722640403": {
            "id": "722640403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "被封印了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640404"
            ]
          },
          "722640404": {
            "id": "722640404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔…倒不是被封印了，应该只是被冰封了吧？毕竟龙脊雪山很冷呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640405"
            ]
          },
          "722640405": {
            "id": "722640405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "哦。好怪哦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640406"
            ]
          },
          "722640406": {
            "id": "722640406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#嗯…这么说来，{NICKNAME}，我们要不要给吉法师「留影」纪念？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640407"
            ]
          },
          "722640407": {
            "id": "722640407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "好主意。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640408"
            ]
          },
          "722640408": {
            "id": "722640408",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640409"
            ]
          },
          "722640409": {
            "id": "722640409",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿。毕竟吉法师也难得来一趟，有相片纪念应该很不错。而且，也可以跟五百藏交差。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640410"
            ]
          },
          "722640410": {
            "id": "722640410",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "就这么决定了。吉法师，乖乖站好！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640411"
            ]
          },
          "722640411": {
            "id": "722640411",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "白毛好奇怪。知道了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7226406",
      "subQuestName": "为吉法师拍照",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722640601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722640601": {
            "id": "722640601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "五百藏",
            "text": "呶！你们回来了！有没有受伤？有没有着凉？肚子饿不饿？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640602"
            ]
          },
          "722640602": {
            "id": "722640602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，如果有吃的话…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640603"
            ]
          },
          "722640603": {
            "id": "722640603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "一切顺利，不用担心。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640604"
            ]
          },
          "722640604": {
            "id": "722640604",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "呶！雪好冷。但是，很好玩。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640605"
            ]
          },
          "722640605": {
            "id": "722640605",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，对了！还有纪念品！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640606"
            ]
          },
          "722640606": {
            "id": "722640606",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "向五百藏展示吉法师在雪山的相片。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640607"
            ]
          },
          "722640607": {
            "id": "722640607",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "五百藏",
            "text": "咿——吉法师！吉法师怎么被封印在纸里面了？！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640608"
            ]
          },
          "722640608": {
            "id": "722640608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "五百藏",
            "text": "这是、这是「地狱绘」？怎么会在你的手里？为什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640610",
              "722640613"
            ]
          },
          "722640610": {
            "id": "722640610",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "五百藏",
            "text": "呜呶呶，怎么会这样…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640611"
            ]
          },
          "722640611": {
            "id": "722640611",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好啦好啦，别欺负五百藏啦。那是「相片」，是一种画。你看，吉法师不是好好的嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640614"
            ]
          },
          "722640614": {
            "id": "722640614",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "耶！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640615"
            ]
          },
          "722640615": {
            "id": "722640615",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "五百藏",
            "text": "咦？两个吉法师…？欸？欸？这是什么法术？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640616"
            ]
          },
          "722640616": {
            "id": "722640616",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "五百藏",
            "text": "…哦，原来如此，是法术嘛！哈哈哈，吉法师，进步很快嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640617"
            ]
          },
          "722640617": {
            "id": "722640617",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "呶哈哈。笨蛋。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640618"
            ]
          },
          "722640618": {
            "id": "722640618",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "真是的，好好听人说话啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640619"
            ]
          },
          "722640619": {
            "id": "722640619",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "多花费了一番口舌，向五百藏解释。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640620"
            ]
          },
          "722640620": {
            "id": "722640620",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "五百藏",
            "text": "…呶，吾辈可是大名鼎鼎的妖狸大王！怎么会不知道「楼影鸡」是什么。吾辈只是考考吉法师。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640621"
            ]
          },
          "722640621": {
            "id": "722640621",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好不知所谓喔。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640622"
            ]
          },
          "722640622": {
            "id": "722640622",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「吉法师」",
            "text": "强词夺理。呶。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722640623"
            ]
          },
          "722640623": {
            "id": "722640623",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "五百藏",
            "text": "咳咳。不管怎么说，看来吉法师的修行很顺利。"
          },
          "722640613": {
            "id": "722640613",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯，别担心！你看，吉法师不是好好的嘛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
